# node_modules is intentionally NOT excluded: it's git-tracked and vendored
# into the image so the build needs no npm-registry egress (THEA-112). The
# only native dep, argon2, ships N-API prebuilds for linux-x64/arm64 musl;
# those prebuilds still link the OS-level libstdc++/libgcc runtime, which the
# Dockerfile installs via apk (THEA-114) — see Dockerfile.
test
.env
.env.*
*.log
npm-debug.log*
